Data sources
------------
- Marstek Open API — local UDP JSON-RPC interface of the battery. Only read-only Get methods are used.
- Львівобленерго (Lvivoblenergo) — public open API of hourly outage schedules, https://api.loe.lviv.ua
- YASNO — public planned-outages API, https://app.yasno.ua
- ua-outages by Pavlo Huk — https://github.com/hukpo/ua-outages — MIT License.
  The app reads the published aggregate https://hukpo.github.io/ua-outages/data/now.json.
- svitlo.live public proxies, and the selection/fallback logic (region slug mapping, schedule scoring)
  ported from chaichuk/svitlo_live (Home Assistant integration) — https://github.com/chaichuk/svitlo_live —
  MIT License.

